CodexBar
--------
The menu-bar quota panel (public/leocodebox-quota.html) and the tray quota
formatting (electron/trayQuota.js) follow the layout and information design of
CodexBar by Peter Steinberger — https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar — which is
distributed under the MIT License. Data acquisition in leocodebox is its own
implementation reading local CLI state; no CodexBar source is bundled.
